# Netlify & Cloudflare Pages read this file and apply these headers to every response.
# They make the page "cross-origin isolated" (needed for multi-threaded ffmpeg.wasm).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
